<section class="section">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <h1 style="font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Simple, Transparent Pricing</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-gray); max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 2rem;">
      Start free, test a real JSON news request, then upgrade when you need more requests, more history, or larger results. View <a href="/en/docs/" style="color: var(--primary-blue); text-decoration: underline;">documentation</a> for API details.
    </p>
    <p style="color: var(--text-gray); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      Over 31,000 developers have registered for Currents API.
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <a href="/en/register" class="btn btn-primary">Create Free Account</a>
      <a href="/en/news-api-key" class="btn btn-outline">Get API Key</a>
      <a href="/en/docs/" class="btn btn-outline">Docs examples</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3" style="max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left;">
      <div style="padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--surface-elevated);">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Request Quotas</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Start with 250 free requests per day. Move to Builder when you need more monthly requests.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--surface-elevated);">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">History Windows</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Choose the plan that matches your required archive depth, from recent access to longer historical search.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--surface-elevated);">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Usage Rights</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Self-service plans provide API access to available fields; redistribution and republication rights require separate terms.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 2rem;">
      <a href="#free-news-api-plan" class="btn btn-outline">Free News API plan</a>
      <a href="/en/latest-news-api" class="btn btn-outline">Latest News API</a>
      <a href="/en/news-api-key" class="btn btn-outline">News API key setup</a>
      <a href="/en/compare/pricing" class="btn btn-outline">Pricing comparison</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-light">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Which plan should I start with?</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Free: try the API</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Use the free plan to get an API key, run your first request, and validate whether Latest News or Search fits your app.</p>
        <a href="/en/register" class="btn btn-primary">Get Free API Key</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Builder $69: serious evaluation</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Choose Builder when a prototype becomes a real integration and needs more monthly volume and archive depth.</p>
        <a href="#builder-plan" class="btn btn-outline">View Builder</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Professional $150: production growth</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Choose Professional for heavier monitoring, enrichment, or production workflows that need larger quota.</p>
        <a href="#pricing-section" class="btn btn-outline">View Professional</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-light" id="free-news-api-plan">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-2" style="align-items: start;">
      <div>
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Free News API plan</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-gray); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          The free developer plan is the entry point for testing Currents with <a href="/en/free-news-api">250 daily requests</a>, recent history access, and clear result limits before moving to paid quotas.
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/en/register" class="btn btn-primary">Create Free Account</a>
          <a href="/en/docs/" class="btn btn-outline">Run First Request</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Plan fit examples</h3>
        <ul style="margin-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0;">
          <li><strong>Free:</strong> prototypes, evaluation, and small news features.</li>
          <li><strong>Builder $69:</strong> production apps that need more monthly volume and archive depth.</li>
          <li><strong>Professional $150:</strong> monitoring, enrichment, and customer-facing products with heavier usage.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Pricing questions</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Is there a free News API plan?</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Yes. The free developer plan includes 250 requests per day for evaluation, prototypes, and small apps.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">When should I upgrade?</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Upgrade when you need higher monthly volume, a longer history window, larger result limits, or production support.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Can I redistribute article content?</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Self-service plans provide technical API access. Redistribution, republication, OEM use, or long-term archival use may require separate terms.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section section-light" id="pricing-section">
  <div class="container">
