        <p class="body-medium text-color-gray-700" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem;">
          Plan quotas are enforced daily and reset at 00:00 UTC. When a day's cap is reached, requests return HTTP 429 with a <code>Retry-After</code> header until the next reset. Unused daily volume does not roll over, and there is no overage billing.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="max-width: 1040px; margin: 2rem auto 0;">
        <div class="section-title-wrap" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          <h2 class="heading-large">Usage Rights</h2>
          <p class="body-medium text-color-gray-700" style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;">
            Self-service plans are for technical API access, processing, attribution, and link-out. If you plan to show AI summaries to customers, republish articles, keep a long-term archive, resell data, or embed Currents into an OEM product, scope it with us before launch.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
          <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden;">
            <thead>
              <tr style="background: var(--bg-light); text-align: left;">
                <th style="padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">Use case</th>
                <th style="padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">Self-service plans</th>
                <th style="padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">Custom Enterprise terms</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">API requests, metadata, available content fields, attribution, and source links</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">Included within plan limits</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">Available for higher limits and SLA needs</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">Internal analysis, monitoring, alerts, and internal RAG workflows</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">Allowed when results stay internal and link back to sources</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">Recommended for teams that need custom retention, review, or compliance terms</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">Customer-facing AI summaries, derivative content products, or article substitutes</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">Not included by default</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">Scope with us before launch</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Long-term caching, persistent vector stores, archives, datasets, OEM distribution, resale, or republication</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Not included by default</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Requires separate terms and may require publisher-side rights</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-3 mb-5">
      <div class="card" style="padding: 2rem; text-align: center;">
        <img src="/static/img/icon-sla.svg" width="48" height="48" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;" alt="Production Reliability">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Production Reliability</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Monitored availability to support business-critical functions. Enterprise SLA terms are available by agreement.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="padding: 2rem; text-align: center;">
        <img src="/static/img/icon-fastnews.svg" width="48" height="48" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;" alt="Fast News Availability">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Fast News Availability</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Newly indexed stories are available to all account tiers without an artificial plan delay.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="padding: 2rem; text-align: center;">
        <img src="/static/img/icon-advancedsearch.svg" width="48" height="48" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;" alt="Advanced Search">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Advanced Search</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Keyword, category, country, language, date, and source filters support focused discovery workflows.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-light">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Cost-Effective News API</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-2 mb-4">
      <div style="padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md);">
        <h4 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Transparent Limits</h4>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Clear request quotas, history access, and result caps by plan</p>
      </div>
